1
00:00:00,170 --> 00:00:02,421
Giving every nation
a different outfit

2
00:00:02,441 --> 00:00:04,726
doesn't give them
different cultures.

3
00:00:04,746 --> 00:00:06,744
At a Varenni funeral,
a visitor sees

4
00:00:06,764 --> 00:00:08,069
everyone laughing.

5
00:00:08,089 --> 00:00:09,199
Cruel?

6
00:00:09,219 --> 00:00:11,068
Look again,
as a Varenni.

7
00:00:11,088 --> 00:00:13,442
Each mourner tells
his funniest failure.

8
00:00:13,462 --> 00:00:15,788
A good life leaves
good stories.

9
00:00:15,808 --> 00:00:17,346
The neighbours sit
closest.

10
00:00:17,366 --> 00:00:19,297
The whole street
raised him.

11
00:00:19,317 --> 00:00:21,201
An outfit is the
surface.

12
00:00:21,221 --> 00:00:22,964
Culture is what
people laugh at,

13
00:00:22,984 --> 00:00:24,414
who's family,
and what makes

14
00:00:24,434 --> 00:00:25,799
someone good.

15
00:00:25,819 --> 00:00:27,188
Follow if you want
your fictional

16
00:00:27,208 --> 00:00:30,163
nations to feel
genuinely different.
